      "content": "Those hypotheses are interesting, but they seem a bit abstract. Can you get more specific about how these theories might explain the actual differences we see in modern society today? Like, when looking at group differences in things like average IQ or general temperament/docility in different parts of the world, how do these biological theories attempt to account for those observed disparities?",
